cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use mhdturbFoamQS, please cite the accompanying paper and the two upstream works listed in NOTICE."
title: "mhdturbFoamQS: a quasi-static MHD solver for OpenFOAM with non-uniform applied magnetic fields"
abstract: >-
  An OpenFOAM 6 solver for incompressible turbulent magnetohydrodynamic flows in
  the low-magnetic-Reynolds-number regime, using the electric-potential
  (quasi-static) formulation with a prescribed, possibly non-uniform, applied
  magnetic field. It avoids the Maxwell-stress cancellation that makes
  full-induction solvers fail with non-uniform applied fields, and keeps the
  standard OpenFOAM turbulence closures unmodified.
type: software
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
